[[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Open the bonnet lid.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891354\">1016A10</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections from the injectors.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890940\">N70</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Disconnect fuel return pipe (2a) for lubricating the injectors\nby removing clip (2b).</p><p>3. Undo bolts (3a),  remove bracket (3b) and take out injectors\n(3c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034168.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check the injectors are in good condition.</p><p>Fit the injectors in their seats.</p><p>Fit the bracket and tighten the retaining\nnuts.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>INJECTORS(DIESEL)</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>3</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Fit  the fuel return pipe for lubricating\nthe injectors and secure it with its clips.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections to the\ninjectors.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890940\">N70</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2891354\">1016A10</a></p><p>Close the bonnet lid.</p>"]]